// config.vlt
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------
// Verilator lint waiver file for tt_um_systolic4x4_q15_booth_pipe.
//
// All three warning classes below are confirmed benign for this project:
//
//   TIMESCALEMOD  - Sky130 gate-level blackbox stub file (auto-generated
//                    by the CI's lint step, not part of this repo) has no
//                    `timescale directive while tt_um_systolic4x4_q15_booth_pipe.v
//                    does. Cosmetic mismatch only, no timing impact.
//
//   GENUNNAMED    - `generate` blocks in skew_delay.v and
//                    systolic_array4x4_1_booth4_pipe.v don't carry
//                    `begin : name` labels. Style-only; does not affect
//                    synthesis, simulation, or functionality.
//
//   UNUSEDSIGNAL  - A handful of signals/ports are intentionally unused:
//                      * pe_q15_booth4_pipe.acc_in   (kept only for
//                        interface compatibility with the original
//                        non-Booth PE; not read internally)
//                      * skew_delay's per-instance valid_out taps in the
//                        array wrapper (array's own valid chain is used
//                        instead)
//                      * core_valid_out in the TT wrapper (core's `done`
//                        pulse is used instead of raw valid_out)
//                      * final_sum[36:32] in radix4_booth_mult16_pipe.v
//                        (deliberately truncated -- product fits in
//                        lower 32 bits per the module's own header
//                        comment)
//
// This file only suppresses lint *warnings*; it does not affect
// synthesis, elaboration, or the produced netlist in any way.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------

lint_off -rule TIMESCALEMOD
lint_off -rule GENUNNAMED
lint_off -rule UNUSEDSIGNAL
